<div class="notice"><p><strong>The latest actual B063R2 run passed startup tests and stopped during prior-source compatibility.</strong> It produced no new scientific fits. The recovered model files and the comparisons below come from authenticated earlier work.</p><p><strong>B063R3 is prepared for owner execution.</strong> The R2 peak of 11.44 measured CPU cores came from engineering probes; zero concurrent scientific workers were observed. Twelve-worker scientific acceptance and a new completed owner return are still pending. This publication does not convert local preparation into an executed training run.</p></div>
